  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.5.12 - Bug-fix release.\n- Instant action copy constructors (CCFlipX, CCFlipY, CCPlace) preserve their state when copied.\n- CCCallFuncN.InitWithTarget returns true on success, matching CCCallFuncO (was false).\n- CCMenuItemSprite: assigning null to NormalImage/SelectedImage/DisabledImage clears the image instead of throwing NullReferenceException.\n- CCTextFieldTTF: auto-edit touch handling re-registers correctly after toggling ReadOnly/AutoEdit.\n- CCRawList: RemoveRange no longer corrupts the list when removing a middle range near the end; also reworked pooled-buffer rent/return handling and fixed a tail-clear buffer leak.\nInternal: completed the private-field naming modernization (Hungarian m_ to _camelCase) library-wide; no public API change.\n2.5.11 - Debut of the consolidated package line replacing the per-platform Cocos2D-Mono.{DesktopGL,Windows,Linux,macOS,Android,iOS} packages (2.5.10 was their final release). Assembly is Cocos2DMono.dll (was Cocos2D.dll; namespace Cocos2D unchanged); OpenTK is no longer a dependency.\n- See https://github.com/Cocos2D-Mono/cocos2d-mono for the full changelog.",
